WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:07.320
How do we express '15 by 20' as a percentage?

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:10.740
We know that if we have to express something as a percentage

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:14.640
we have to make its 'denominator equal to 100'.

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:16.460
So '15 by 20'

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:20.180
should equal some number 'x by hundred'.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:25.500
To find the percentage we just have to find out what this 'x' is.

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:28.280
These are actually two equal ratios,

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:30.840
which means this is proportion.

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:32.680
Since this is proportion

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:34.600
'15 multiplied by 100'

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:37.520
is equal to '20 multiplied by x'.

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:39.760
The product of the extremes

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:43.040
is always equal to the product of the means.

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:45.360
Transposing 20 to the other side

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:51.420
we write 'x' as '15 multiplied by 100' 'divided by 20'.

00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:54.300
'100 divided by 20' is '5'.

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:57.940
And hence, 'x' is equal to '15 multiplied by 5'

00:00:58.080 --> 00:01:00.320
which equals '75'.

00:01:00.680 --> 00:01:04.900
Hence '15 by 20 is 75 by 100'.

00:01:05.260 --> 00:01:08.420
And that is equivalent to '75 percent'.

00:01:08.740 --> 00:01:12.840
This was the concept of how we converted into percentage form.

00:01:13.100 --> 00:01:14.700
But notice what we did.

00:01:14.980 --> 00:01:18.780
All we did was multiply the fraction by hundred.

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:20.960
Can we do this every time?

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:24.440
Yes, to convert a fraction to percentage terms,

00:01:24.440 --> 00:01:27.140
we just have to 'multiply it by 100'.

00:01:27.460 --> 00:01:28.520
All this was done

00:01:28.660 --> 00:01:30.440
just so that you can understand

00:01:30.460 --> 00:01:33.080
why we multiply the fraction by 100.

00:01:33.540 --> 00:01:36.160
It's because we want the denominator to be hundred,

00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:38.900
and since these are equivalent ratios,

00:01:39.020 --> 00:01:42.440
we multiply '15 by 20' by '100'.

00:01:42.760 --> 00:01:46.340
Let's express '3 by 5' as a percentage.

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:49.860
We 'multiply 3 by 5' by '100'.

00:01:50.220 --> 00:01:52.260
'5 times 20' is '100'.

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:55.520
And '20 times 3' is '60'.

00:01:55.900 --> 00:01:57.760
That gives us '60'.

00:01:57.980 --> 00:02:01.660
So '3 by 5 is equal to 60 percent'.

00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:04.980
Remember, to convert a fraction to percentage

00:02:04.980 --> 00:02:07.800
just multiply the fraction by 100.

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:11.740
This formula will help you solve problems really quick.

